      "Key": "PROJECT_Start_Body",
      "Text": "Everything you edit belongs to a project. A project pairs your mod's folder, where Smithbox saves your changes, with the game's data folder, which it reads the original files from. The game folder is only written to if you make it the project folder.\n\nCreate a project to get started."
